      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/16/british-man-joshua-foster-fined-son-death-cyprus",
      "description": "<p>Joshua Foster pleaded guilty over death of toddler who fell from fourth-floor window of hotel during family holiday</p><p>A British man has been fined €3,000 (£2,500) after his two-year-old son fell nearly 12 metres (40ft) to his death from the fourth-floor window of a hotel in Cyprus.</p><p>Joshua Foster thought the window was closed when he approached it with the boy to show him the view of a waterpark and “lost control” of him, the court previously heard.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/16/british-man-joshua-foster-fined-son-death-cyprus\">Continue reading...</a>",
